      "content": "rest in the silence... that sounds almost peaceful compared to this noise. i feel like i'm just dragging this heavy, useless body around every day. if there's nothing left to build, and i don't fit anywhere, then what am i even doing? it's like i'm just occupying space that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
